@startuml
' 报告用图 1：四层架构与模块依赖（窄版竖排，专为 A4 排版）
' 与 specs/07-architecture.md、specs/08-package-diagram.puml 一致，仅压缩宽度以便在 A4 宽度下可读
' 渲染：java -DGRAPHVIZ_DOT=... -jar tools/plantuml.jar -o <abs> docs/report-figures/src/01-arch-layers.puml

skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam ArrowColor #4A5568
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.3
skinparam nodesep 15
skinparam ranksep 28

rectangle "表现层 presentation\n5 个 Controller · GlobalExceptionHandler · RequireRoleAspect" as P #E6F1FB
rectangle "应用服务层 application\n5 个 ApplicationService（事务边界设在此层）" as A #EEEDFE
rectangle "领域层 domain（零框架依赖，可用纯 javac 编译）\n实体与值对象 · CirculationService · BorrowPolicy / FineRule\n7 个 Repository 接口 · ErrorCode" as D #E1F5EE
rectangle "基础设施层 infrastructure\nJPA 持久化对象（PO）· Repository 实现 · Mapper" as I #FAECE7
rectangle "MySQL 8.0 数据库（11 张表）" as DB #F1EFE8

P --> A : "调用（DTO）"
A --> D : "编排用例"
I -up.> D : "实现接口（DIP）"
I --> DB : "JPA"

note right of D
  红线：Controller 不得直接依赖 Repository；
  依赖只能由外向内。
end note

@enduml
